A portal implementation (views, GraphQL queries, translations and static files) can now be loaded from Mesh. When the new configuration option `portalImplementation` (environment variable `PORTAL_IMPLEMENTATION`) is set, the command `php artisan portal:implementation:sync` downloads the package of the portal implementation with this keyword. The command must be run when the portal is started, and it is scheduled every minute to apply changes, which requires the Laravel scheduler. Views, GraphQL queries and translations replace the local files. Static files (folder `static` of the package) are copied into the folder `public/static` and served in addition to the existing files; for files with the same path, the portal implementation wins.